  "solution": {
    "text": "Energy <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />For small % errors, we can, do differentiation<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Fractional error <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math><br /><br />% error <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0.2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math> (errors always add up)<br /><br />Alternate solution:<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />Taking natural logarithm on both sides,<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />Differentiating<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />For small fractional erros, errors always add up<br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">α</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0.2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math>",
